    "name": "Raccoon Cocoon: A Cozy Puzzle Game",
    "steam_appid": 3666490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Grandma Raccoon\u2019s pixel home and help her bring order to everyday chaos. Relax, organize, and take joy in the little things with Raccoon Cocoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9\u2728 <i>Cozy puzzles, gentle vibes. That\u2019s the spirit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you inside this warm little cocoon?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize books, sort drawers, and line up cozy clutter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidy up cute cacti, flowers, and mushroom collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy retro-inspired mini games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying symmetry, pattern-matching, and visual logic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No timers, no stress \u2014 just pure cozy vibes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Whether you\u2019re emptying boxes or pressing flowers in a book, every puzzle is a quiet little moment with Grandma Raccoon. Put the kettle on and take your time \u2014 she\u2019s in no rush. \ud83c\udf75</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Grandma Raccoon\u2019s pixel home and help her bring order to everyday chaos. Relax, organize, and take joy in the little things with Raccoon Cocoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9\u2728 <i>Cozy puzzles, gentle vibes. That\u2019s the spirit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you inside this warm little cocoon?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize books, sort drawers, and line up cozy clutter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidy up cute cacti, flowers, and mushroom collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy retro-inspired mini games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying symmetry, pattern-matching, and visual logic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No timers, no stress \u2014 just pure cozy vibes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Whether you\u2019re emptying boxes or pressing flowers in a book, every puzzle is a quiet little moment with Grandma Raccoon. Put the kettle on and take your time \u2014 she\u2019s in no rush. \ud83c\udf75</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/f9b44baa0b5439246cef1c2b7263e605.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.poster.avif?t=1751720449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.webm?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.mp4?t=1751720449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Raccoon Cocoon is a charming pixel art puzzle game where you join Grandma Raccoon and help her organize the little details of life in a relaxing way. From everyday clutter to the small messes nature brings, everything is waiting to be tidied up with calm and care!",
